fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Move Speed}}
** Checks Ezalor's total {{M|strength}} per {{M|server tick}} and updates its [[movement speed]] bonus values.
** {{cf|expr}}
*** {{Code|Bonus[[Movement Speed|MS]] {{=}} ( [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌈]] Σ[[Intelligence|Int]] / {{#var:Bright Speed value1}} [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions⌋|⌉]] ) × f([[#Spirit Form|SpiritForm]])}}
*** {{Code|MAX f(SpiritForm) {{=}} ({{#var:Bright Speed type1 value1}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Keeper of the Light|v2r}}|tal|x}})}}
**** {{cf|talnotes}} Learning the {{ValueColor||movement speed factor increasing|15tal}} {{M|talent|t=t2r}} immediately updates the current {{A|Keeper of the Light|Spirit Form}} instance.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
*** Grants a {{#var:Bright Speed type2 value3}}-second {{#var:Bright Speed type2 value2}}-radius [[flying vision]] cell upon proc.
*** Each created vision radius has its own independent linger duration.
** {{Symbol|a|Counter}}
*** The distance accumulation counter never resets.
*** Checks and adapts the ability values accordingly per {{M|server tick}} per {{#var:Bright Speed type2 value1}} distance Ezalor moved, including {{M|forced movement}} sources.
*** The following sources do not increase the distance counter:
**** {{M|Upward movement}} sources.
**** {{M|Teleport}} sources.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Bright Speed icon0}}
| desc = Keeper of the Light gains <span class="GameplayVariable">1</span> movement speed for every 3 Intelligence.<br><br>Whenever Keeper of the Light moves 300 distance, he leaves behind light that allows him to see 400 range for 3 seconds.
}}

