fields.value:
 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Solar Bind icon0}}
| desc = Weakens an enemy's magical resistance, and applies a slow that increases in strength the more the target moves.
}}
* {{Symbol|Move Speed}}
** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*** The ability's visual particles on the affected enemy unit indicates the [[movement speed]] slow's potency, capped at {{#var:Solar Bind type2 value3}}.
** {{Symbol|fx|s}}
*** The ability's sound effect volume also increases while the affected enemy unit is moving.

* {{Symbol|a|Down}} {{Symbol|Magic Resistance}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} 
** The debuff-affected enemy hero now has {{Code|{{calc|1-(1-{{G|magic resistance}})*(1+v1)|v1={{#var:Solar Bind value2}}|%}} + {{calc|v1*{{G|bonus magic resistance}}|v1={{#var:Solar Bind value2}}|%}} × Σ[[Intelligence|Int]]}} [[magic resistance]] at max reduction value.
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}} Acquiring the {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}} immediately grants {{ValueColor||1|shd}} extra charge.

